WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.268 --> 00:00:03.770
We are following developments

00:00:03.770 --> 00:00:05.238
in Ukraine, where officials

00:00:05.238 --> 00:00:06.840
say Russia has launched

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:09.943
a new round of missile and drone attacks

00:00:10.310 --> 00:00:11.845
Several regions in the east

00:00:11.845 --> 00:00:12.879
were targeted,

00:00:12.879 --> 00:00:15.382
including de Dnipropetrovsk,

00:00:15.715 --> 00:00:17.283
where more than two dozen

00:00:17.283 --> 00:00:19.119
people have been injured,

00:00:19.119 --> 00:00:21.154
including three children.

00:00:21.154 --> 00:00:24.991
A top Ukrainian commanders says 15 of 18

00:00:24.991 --> 00:00:26.326
cruise missiles fired

00:00:26.326 --> 00:00:28.361
by Russia were intercepted.

00:00:28.695 --> 00:00:29.963
And a Ukrainian official

00:00:29.963 --> 00:00:30.630
in Kiev

00:00:30.630 --> 00:00:32.899
says the country's air defense forces

00:00:33.133 --> 00:00:34.768
destroyed Russian missiles

00:00:34.768 --> 00:00:37.037
in the airspace above the capital.

00:00:38.104 --> 00:00:40.340
Funerals were held in the Ukrainian city

00:00:40.340 --> 00:00:42.509
of Oman, barely a day

00:00:42.509 --> 00:00:43.810
after a missile strike

00:00:43.810 --> 00:00:45.812
killed 25 people

00:00:45.812 --> 00:00:47.647
in an apartment building.

00:00:47.647 --> 00:00:50.517
Yes, because this week, many of your

00:00:50.517 --> 00:00:52.719
impressions of all

00:00:54.020 --> 00:00:56.890
the family and residents say farewell

00:00:56.890 --> 00:00:58.691
to a brother and sister

00:00:58.691 --> 00:01:00.794
who died in that attack.

00:01:00.794 --> 00:01:01.928
Ukrainian President

00:01:01.928 --> 00:01:03.363
Volodymyr Zelensky said

00:01:03.363 --> 00:01:04.964
the government will do everything

00:01:04.964 --> 00:01:06.566
it can to hold accountable

00:01:06.566 --> 00:01:08.234
the people responsible

00:01:08.234 --> 00:01:10.637
for killing innocent civilians.

00:01:10.637 --> 00:01:12.138
CNN's Nic Robertson spoke

00:01:12.138 --> 00:01:13.740
with residents of the community

00:01:13.740 --> 00:01:15.141
who were paying their respects

00:01:19.012 --> 00:01:21.214
in the shadow of death.

00:01:21.214 --> 00:01:24.984
There is love, floral tributes and toys

00:01:25.218 --> 00:01:28.388
for victims of Russia's strike in Uman Fri

00:01:29.055 --> 00:01:29.622
Anna.

00:01:29.622 --> 00:01:31.091
15 years old,

00:01:31.091 --> 00:01:33.593
is paying respects to her near neighbors.

00:01:34.794 --> 00:01:37.730
So many innocent children died, she says.

00:01:38.231 --> 00:01:39.299
I'm so sorry.

00:01:39.299 --> 00:01:41.601
They're not alive anymore.

00:01:41.601 --> 00:01:43.770
More than a day after the apartments

00:01:43.770 --> 00:01:46.706
destroyed, recovery winding down.

00:01:47.173 --> 00:01:50.143
25 dead, six of them children.

00:01:51.444 --> 00:01:52.479
Victoria points

00:01:52.479 --> 00:01:54.347
to where her father lived.

00:01:54.347 --> 00:01:57.784
This one was with the blue wall here

00:01:57.784 --> 00:01:59.986
they are overseas.

00:01:59.986 --> 00:02:01.721
She lists all the neighbors

00:02:01.721 --> 00:02:03.323
who are now dead.

00:02:03.323 --> 00:02:04.257
On the ninth floor,

00:02:04.257 --> 00:02:05.225
a grandma,

00:02:05.225 --> 00:02:07.627
her daughter and two great grandchildren.

00:02:08.027 --> 00:02:10.330
On the eighth floor, a father and son.

00:02:10.663 --> 00:02:11.798
On the seventh floor,

00:02:11.798 --> 00:02:14.601
a mother and daughter, my best friend.

00:02:15.068 --> 00:02:17.237
And on the sixth floor, a young couple.

00:02:17.370 --> 00:02:19.539
Both 33 of them.

00:02:20.140 --> 00:02:22.242
Her father survived.

00:02:22.242 --> 00:02:24.043
It was a miracle, he says.

00:02:24.043 --> 00:02:25.845
They rescued me with a ladder

00:02:25.845 --> 00:02:27.547
and people gave me clothes.

00:02:29.015 --> 00:02:29.782
Victoria

00:02:29.782 --> 00:02:31.351
shows us documents

00:02:31.351 --> 00:02:33.620
a letter to a now dead friend.

00:02:33.620 --> 00:02:36.256
The photo of another neighbor

00:02:36.256 --> 00:02:38.057
she tells us she found them

00:02:38.057 --> 00:02:40.560
blowing in the wind.

00:02:40.560 --> 00:02:42.562
This is so important, she says.

00:02:42.562 --> 00:02:44.164
They're all that's left.

00:02:44.164 --> 00:02:47.233
The recovery is painstakingly slow.

00:02:47.901 --> 00:02:50.436
The wait for answers about the missing

00:02:50.803 --> 00:02:52.405
just as painful.

00:02:52.405 --> 00:02:55.141
But in all the grief, there is humanity

00:02:55.775 --> 00:02:57.644
and there is anger

00:02:58.178 --> 00:02:59.612
in a nearby school.

00:02:59.612 --> 00:03:01.581
Neighbors sought clothes,

00:03:01.581 --> 00:03:04.184
a gift for survivors who lost everything.

00:03:04.584 --> 00:03:06.586
We saw all this family, the children.

00:03:06.586 --> 00:03:07.387
They were crying.

00:03:07.387 --> 00:03:08.254
And I don't know.

00:03:08.254 --> 00:03:08.922
We just felt

00:03:08.922 --> 00:03:10.223
that was something

00:03:10.223 --> 00:03:11.891
we need to do to help them.

00:03:11.891 --> 00:03:14.427
We feel hate for our

00:03:15.128 --> 00:03:16.462
Russian neighbors,

00:03:16.462 --> 00:03:18.765
if we can call him like that.

00:03:18.765 --> 00:03:21.901
But most we are focused on helping just

00:03:21.901 --> 00:03:22.602
only happen.

00:03:23.703 --> 00:03:24.671
Police already

00:03:24.671 --> 00:03:26.906
documenting the scale of the loss.

00:03:27.173 --> 00:03:28.007
Boris BOF

00:03:28.007 --> 00:03:30.009
telling them his vehicle destroyed.

00:03:31.211 --> 00:03:32.912
It's not what's been destroyed

00:03:32.912 --> 00:03:34.881
that matters, he tells us.

00:03:34.881 --> 00:03:36.783
It's the lost lives.

00:03:36.783 --> 00:03:38.851
We sent photos of the destruction

00:03:39.052 --> 00:03:41.221
to our distant relatives in Russia

00:03:41.221 --> 00:03:43.890
so they can see what their army is doing.

00:03:44.524 --> 00:03:47.760
They didn't reply, he says.

00:03:48.261 --> 00:03:50.196
All around, life is being

00:03:50.196 --> 00:03:52.899
put back in some sort of order.

00:03:54.367 --> 00:03:56.436
The broken, patched up.

00:03:56.436 --> 00:03:59.105
But ask anyone about repairing relations

00:03:59.105 --> 00:04:00.306
with Russia.

00:04:00.306 --> 00:04:02.875
What do you think about about Russia now?

00:04:03.443 --> 00:04:04.644
Animals

00:04:07.113 --> 00:04:09.916
Imagine that for the next generation.

00:04:10.250 --> 00:04:11.818
Russia's attack.

00:04:11.818 --> 00:04:13.920
A life shaping memory.

00:04:14.854 --> 00:04:17.156
Nic Robertson, CNN, human.

00:04:17.423 --> 00:04:18.124
Ukraine.

